## 1. Definitions

1.1 **"Program"** means any work protected by copyright that is licensed under this License.

1.2 **"Modification"** means any copy or largely similar copy of the Program, unaltered, altered, and/or translated into another language, as well as any work that contains or is built upon the Program or substantial parts of it.

1.3 **"Distribution"** means any act by which copies of the Program or a Modification are transferred to third parties, including as part of a larger work or product, and including over a network (e.g. download, app store, package manager, or provision as a service).

1.4 **"Sale"** means any distribution of the Program, a copy of it, or a Modification in exchange for money or a monetary equivalent, where payment is required for the Program itself (or for access to it, or for possession of a copy). **Not a Sale** under this License, in particular: voluntary donations with no obligation attached, payment for support, maintenance, or consulting services related to the Program, and fees for hosting or operating an instance of the Program (e.g. server costs), as long as the software itself remains freely available. Operating a server (e.g. a game server) that runs the Program and selling in-game items, ranks, or memberships is not a Sale of the Program, provided the Program itself is not offered for payment.

